# 301 redirects for pages removed in "Remove Singapore, Thailand, and slots pages"
# (commit 6e21890, 2026-08-10). Without this file, Cloudflare Pages was silently
# falling back to serving the homepage at these URLs with a canonical tag pointing
# to /, which reads to Google as a soft-404 / duplicate-content signal rather than
# a clean permanent move - these three URLs are still indexed with their old,
# page-specific titles. Added 2026-09-13.
/longfu88-singapore / 301
/longfu88-singapore.html / 301
/longfu88-thailand / 301
/longfu88-thailand.html / 301
/slots / 301
/slots.html / 301

# Canonical URL hygiene (Cloudflare Pages strips .html via 308; keep one hop)
/index.html / 301

# Prefer non-www
https://www.longfu88asia.com/* https://longfu88asia.com/:splat 301
